      "id": "claim_cc550335a03048cdb9b4340abfc68158",
      "statement": "EncryptionKey derives four domain-separated 256-bit subkeys (payload_key, filename_siv_key, filename_cipher_key, ipc_auth_key) from a single 256-bit master key using BLAKE2b-512 with distinct context labels (oifs.kdf.v2.payload.xchacha20poly1305, oifs.kdf.v2.filename.siv.blake2b, oifs.kdf.v2.filename.aead.xchacha20poly1305, oifs.kdf.v2.ipc.auth.blake2b). The master key is never used directly for any cryptographic operation.",
